WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Are you still noisy?

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,640
You live in such a good society

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,960
No need to fight, no need to worry about eating Sichuan

4
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,360
You should be a good person

5
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,560
I dare not say that I want to set an example

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,720
But at least one must have the most basic character of a person

7
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,640
Otherwise, you are not worthy of this world at all.

8
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,720
Brother, you are right. Let us go.

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,720
We promise never to do it again

10
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,080
Be more honest next time or else

11
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:23,480
What a shame for my young man, dad. Mom, this is Xiao Zhengbei, my boyfriend.

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:28,640
Is my daughter worthy of her? Xiao Xiao, hello. My name is Zhu Ziran. This is my wife, Liu Rong. Hello, come in and sit down.

13
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:32,800
Where is Xiao Xiao from Shazhou?

14
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,480
Just a younger brother's name

15
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,120
Don't you know it's normal?

16
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:39,440
So what kind of job do you do, carrying buildings?

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,200
It’s just a coolie that you can swipe on your mobile phone.

18
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,840
Is my job embarrassing?

19
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,080
People nearby this winter

20
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,480
Sure enough, the idea is different

21
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,680
Why is this young man not nervous at all?

22
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,360
Most people can't do this.

23
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,440
The boyfriend you found is actually a hard worker

24
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,560
Still a builder

25
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,640
what do you think

26
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,400
What's wrong? I don't have a boyfriend.

27
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,080
He keeps urging me to find a boyfriend

28
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:59,160
Now I've found a great guy, pick three and minus four.
